Tests T1 = (1, 1) and T2 = (0, 5) are run on the function below. Which coverage criteria reach 100%?
int classify(int x, int y) {
  int r = 0;
  if (x > 0 && y > 0)
    r = 1;
  if (x == 0)
    r = -1;
  return r;
}

