Tests sales = 2000 and sales = 1500 are run on the code below. Counting the true and false outcome of each decision, what is the branch coverage, and which single extra test would raise it to 100%?
if (sales > 1800)
  c = high(sales);
else if (sales > 1000)
  c = mid(sales);
else
  c = low(sales);

